cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BEACON: Bus and External-link Awareness, Continuity, Observation, and Notification for FTC"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Allsparks"
    alias: "FTC Team 36117"
    website: "https://github.com/The-Allsparks"
repository-code: "https://github.com/The-Allsparks/BEACON"
url: "https://github.com/The-Allsparks/BEACON"
abstract: >-
  BEACON is a phased communications-health and safe-state library for
  FIRST Tech Challenge robots. It begins with passive observation and
  preflight verification. Warnings, correlation, communication-loss
  safe states, bounded recovery, and degraded operation remain disabled
  until validated.
keywords:
  - FIRST Tech Challenge
  - FTC
  - communications
  - fault detection
  - health monitoring
  - safe state
  - robotics
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0-SNAPSHOT"
date-released: "2026-08-17"
